      "reasoning": "Opponent is attacking with Ornery Goblin (2/1). My Spark Reaper is 2/3 but has summoning sickness... wait, it can still block! The Ornery Goblin deals 1 extra damage when blocked, so my Reaper would take 2+1=3 damage total and die, while I deal 2 damage to the Goblin killing it. Hmm, let me think...\n\
