      "player": "Opus Folksy",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Turn 5. I'm at 16 life (took 2 from Ornery Goblin twice, and they double-blocked my Reaper). The opponent played Icebind Pillar — that can tap down my creatures with snow mana. They also have a second Mountain now.\n\
