      "reasoning": "Ossuary Rats ETB trigger — 1 damage to target creature. I need to kill Avalanche Caller (1/3)! 1 damage kills a 1/3? No, 1 damage to a 1/3 leaves it at 1/2. It doesn't kill it.\n\
\n\
Hmm, then which target is best? Goblin Shortcutter is 2/1 — 1 damage kills it! That removes a 2/1 attacker. Berg Strider (4/4) — 1 damage leaves it at 4/3, irrelevant. Avalanche Caller (1/3) — 1 damage leaves it at 1/2.\n\
\n\
